Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package is a customized ("Bao") derivative of the Ping Business
merchant-store UI (Apache License 2.0, §4(b)). The Ping Business-originated
files listed in MODIFICATIONS.md have been changed, and new brand assets,
self-hosted OFL webfonts, and a footer component have been added. The
customization is limited to presentation (brand tokens, typography, assets,
copy, layout, accessibility). It does not modify the API contract, the runtime
`ESTORE_APP_PUBLIC_URL` same-origin configuration, authentication/refresh, cart
revalidation, checkout/subscription, or status-polling behavior.

See MODIFICATIONS.md for the per-file change inventory and DESIGN_REPORT.md for
details. "Ping Business" is a trademark of Ping Business; see TRADEMARKS.md. This
customized deployment is not operated, certified, sponsored, or endorsed by Ping
Business. Merchant-supplied and third-party assets retain their own ownership
